{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Now</b> — the words of each one, thus they speak. Or they are the words of the poet in the holy spirit, and this is the correct view in my eyes." "<b>and His anointed</b> — he is David, or the anointed is his son. And wherein will He answer him? In the might of salvation that the right hand of HaShem will perform, not the right hand of David, on account of him who comes after him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:57.847241391Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}